              <heading>Section 10</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “and 8”, substitute “, 8 and 8A”.</p>
                <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                <p><i>House of Representatives on 24 May 2018</i></p>
                <p><i>Senate on 19 June 2018</i>]</p>
                <p>(100/18)</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
